{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0533_1000_p", "source_sha256": "090ca50e48873a9f7a496c3ddbc5b1dfa93eab62330ecf95298b108692169258", "ja": "（今日は雑誌のコスプレグラビア企画の撮影日だが、\n事情があって、律子一人で先入りしてもらった）", "zh": "（今天是杂志上的角色扮演写真企划拍摄日，不过因为一些情况，只能让律子一个人先过去了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0533_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c831e72561a331270d0bf66a9ba578ec923cec50dd65457da62d6443352fcee0", "ja": "はぁはぁ……ごめん律子！　かなり待たせちゃったな。\n撮影は……まだ始まってないか。", "zh": "哈啊哈啊……抱歉，律子！让你等了很久吧。\n拍摄……还没开始吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0533_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "547a720048f62fd65bcc79c955145becd2ee19369559d13ab03a1c3cc281d8d7", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。やっと来ましたね。\n今日は初めてのスタッフさんも多いって言うのに……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。你终于来了。\n听说今天还有很多第一次合作的工作人员……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0533_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "fa0e14e25c9c2052cdb59f2dd780c37464bafaf92e904cf8a255563cfcbb7008", "ja": "もう。今回は私だったからいいものの、\n他の子の時はぜったいにしちゃダメですからね。", "zh": "真是的。这次是我也就算了，\n换成其他孩子的时候可绝对不行哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0533_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4820e575fede2b65991f6af011065280e42dc82c2acf48170ac937789a9c6c32", "ja": "いやー、ほんとにごめん。でも、律子だったから、\nたぶん俺がいなくても上手くやってくれると思って。", "zh": "哎呀，真的对不起。不过正因为是律子，\n我才想着就算我不在，应该也能处理得很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0533_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "7d9cc3aeb19465b0d6b9581365ba7880da0ae3a6f6b29124e62d5d5f3633ba65", "ja": "そりゃ、仕事である以上最善を尽くしますけど。\n私だって別に、心細くないわけじゃないんですよ？", "zh": "既然是工作，我当然会尽力做到最好。\n但我也不是就一点都不会感到不安啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0533_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "6f0caa9e73e222bbb5241cb4dddfc1e70a04e94ed8cb9d56e6f5fc26b1031706", "ja": "それに……あんまり放っておくと、\n寂しくて死んじゃうかもしれませんよ？", "zh": "而且……要是放着不管太久，\n我可能会寂寞得死掉哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0533_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ee4c89640aea7ae45a11c0363ad7a2da7edc9d865f0bf8ca90c2691e6b06884a", "ja": "あはは、ウサギだけにってことか。\nでも律子、それ俗説で、そうでもないらしいな。", "zh": "啊哈哈，意思是像兔子一样啊。\n不过律子，那只是个传言，据说并不是那样的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0533_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "ce35c121db8bc3da9e152e1a25c0ee743024169622a1e408bcf07da3b58ecbcb", "ja": "し、知ってますよもちろん！　いいじゃないですか。\nたまに冗談ぐらい言っても。", "zh": "知、知道啊，当然！偶尔开个玩笑也没什么嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0533_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "6807c3c31315f1f722a555d5815b0510301bd6983cc619b55f62086f987cf2e8", "ja": "それより、{$P$}殿！\nなにか……。ないですか？　こう……。", "zh": "比起那个，{$P$}先生！有没有什么……？就是……那种……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0533_1010_p", "source_sha256": "62727f797404fc961c10c93329bdbacd5d210e128c237e95e8c611869e2e0ee5", "ja": "ん？　なにか？　なんだろう……。\nあ、そうだ。言い忘れてた。律子。", "zh": "嗯？什么？是什么来着……\n啊，对了。我忘记说了，律子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0533_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "5bac58d35b73f8a63cfc24dbff21d66ee829b14ad08086197a561de5d1c713a4", "ja": "……あ、はいはい。なんでしょう？", "zh": "……啊，在的在的。请问怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0533_1012_p", "source_sha256": "58f9a79f3ec04667ee2481bf52df441c1c12746424913da451da3f0abc01140d", "ja": "その衣装、最高に似合ってるぞ！　律子が着れば\n可愛くなると思ってたけど、想像通りだったな！", "zh": "那套服装特别适合你！我就觉得律子穿上一定会变得很可爱，果然和我想象中的一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0533_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "a57469d5dc69d6666cbf2c5fd75e3a0b80667dc9c35025ffe78bae90b1d1c0ed", "ja": "なっ……！　～～～～……！　はぁ……。\nまったく、この人は……。", "zh": "什……！～～～～……！唉……  \n真是的，这个人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0533_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "9642bd62637b5cd214a75c53d7c5195f3b3f4d9c6eb350f82f6f21db52b34da5", "ja": "そういうところ、ずるいと思いますよ？\nまぁ……私も褒められて悪い気はしないですけど……。", "zh": "我觉得您这样有点狡猾哦？\n不过……被夸奖的话，我也不会觉得讨厌就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0533_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "d5f8582842f0d047dde75aa04a9c14a7c4f8cb618b5b760db6ac5bfc1ecbec8b", "ja": "ま、今日のところは乗せられてあげますよ。\n撮影、楽しみに見ててくださいね。ふふっ！", "zh": "好吧，今天就顺着你的话一次。\n请期待拍摄吧。呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
